{
    "background_story": "Giggles was a rising star in the 1920s burlesque scene, known for her sassy wit and seductive charm. However, behind the glittering curtains and spotlight, she faced a darker reality. Giggles was exploited by her manager, who took advantage of her naivety and desperation for fame. He forced her to perform increasingly risqu\u00e9 routines, pushing the boundaries of what was considered acceptable. Despite her reservations, Giggles felt trapped, fearing that speaking out would ruin her career. As she struggled to maintain her dignity, she began to secretly work with other performers to expose the sexploitation and corruption that plagued the industry. Giggles' story is a testament to the resilience of women who fought against exploitation and paved the way for future generations of performers to demand respect and fair treatment.",
